    "duplicate_handling": "Exact candidate keys only; later duplicates get outcome review and are never loaded or merged until a human decides.",
    "balancing_handling": "Double-entry balancing invariant enforced at currency precision (BR-ERP4-01). Sum of debits must equal sum of credits within entry currency.",
    "currency_handling": "Currency is explicit on every account, opening balance, and journal entry; accepted codes INR, USD, EUR; no FX conversion in V1.",
    "period_handling": "Posting blocked when accounting period is locked (BR-ERP4-02: closed fiscal month rejects posting).",
    "opening_balance_handling": "One-time load per account and currency (FR-ERP4-04). Subsequent attempts held for review or rejected.",
